<h3 class="heading-size-3 first" id="raid-best-in-slot-gear-for-blood-death-knights">Raid Best-in-Slot Gear for Blood Death Knights</h3>This list represents the best gear available from all raids in Phase 1 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, though keep in mind that raid best-in-slot gear will be acquired over several weeks, if not months, for most players, so be sure to sim your character with the gear you actually have in order to ensure you are using the best combination.<br/>
