<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="set-bonuses">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Blood Death Knight in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses for Blood Death Knights in Phase 1 are quite lackluster, and even in a full BiS set, you generally don't use the 4-piece bonus. The 20-sec CD reduction of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=55233/vampiric-blood">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_lifedrain.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vampiric Blood</span></a> is a solid bonus, as it allows us to more frequently cover moments of vulnerability when we don't have <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=49222/bone-shield">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_deathknight_boneshield.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bone Shield</span></a> active. Because the helmet and chest slot have our preferred stats, including at least these two pieces should be a no-brainer. <br/>
<br/>The 4-piece may seem good on paper, but it offers limited utility in actuality, while having suboptimal stats. It does have a niche use-case on <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60999/sha-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Fear</span></a>. <br/>
<br/>The DPS tier set is also worth giving a look over for a more offensive set, as some of the pieces will be part of your Best in Slot list, but the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1123/battlegear-of-the-lost-catacomb">set bonus</a> offers no value whatsoever.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
